# Testing

Guide: `docs/TESTING.md`, `docs/E2E-AND-A11Y.md`.

## Unit (Vitest)

- Colocate `*.test.ts` / `*.spec.ts` next to source under `src/`
- Route tests may use `__tests__/` (e.g. `src/routes/api/health/__tests__/`)
- `happy-dom`, `globals: true`
- `$env/*` is aliased to `src/lib/test-stubs/` in `vitest.config.ts`
- Shared helpers: `src/lib/test-utils.ts`
- Run: `npm test` (file: `npm test src/lib/rateLimit.test.ts`)

When you change a module that already has tests, update those tests. Add tests for new public helpers.

## E2E / a11y (Playwright)

- Specs: `tests/e2e/*.spec.ts`
- `npm run test:e2e` · a11y only: `npm run test:a11y` (`accessibility.spec.ts` + axe)

## Question-bank realism

Per-track `src/convex/seed/*-realism.test.ts` and large-bank checks **auto-skip** when `devQuestionBank.private.ts` is the tiny stub (`< ~100KB` / `< 400` rows). Do not “fix” CI by weakening realism assertions; keep skips tied to `isFullQuestionBank()`.

## Convex tests

Prefer testing pure helpers (`lib/authorization.ts`, `lib/practiceAccess.ts`, catalog realism) without a live deployment. Do not call production Convex or commit secrets in fixtures.
